--- !u!1001 &1413598202
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[0]'
      value: A few days later...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[1]'
      value: 'And now for some good news: Plutos Industries has successfully met
        its production target for the year.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[2]'
      value: "The workers expressed their gratitude, saying, \u201CThis achievement
        is thanks to our CEO\u2019s dedication to the team.\u201D"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[3]'
      value: "The company\u2019s robust production system is especially impressive,\nwith
        its successful repairs of robots showing unusual behavior."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[4]'
      value: 'The cause of the abnormal overloads remains unknown,

        but the
        company reports that the robots were reset and the issue fully resolved.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[5]'
      value: Plutos Industries says it plans to continue improving productivity through
        ongoing technological innovation...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[6]'
      value: "<Ending 2/4 \u2014 Second Ending: Oblivion>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[1]'
      value: "\uB2E4\uC74C\uC73C\uB85C \uC804\uD574\uB4DC\uB9B4 \uAC83\uC740 \uCD95\uD558\uD560
        \uB9CC\uD55C \uC18C\uC2DD\uC778\uB370\uC694,\n\uD50C\uB8E8\uD1A0\uC2A4\uACF5\uC5C5\uC774
        \uC62C\uD574 \uC0DD\uC0B0 \uBAA9\uD45C\uB97C \uC131\uACF5\uC801\uC73C\uB85C
        \uB2EC\uC131\uD588\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[2]'
      value: "\uADFC\uB85C\uC790 \uCE21\uC740 \u2018\uC774\uBC88 \uC131\uACFC\uB294
        \uAD6C\uC131\uC6D0\uB4E4\uC744 \uC704\uD574 \uB178\uB825\uD558\uB294 \uCD1D\uCC45\uC784\uC790
        \uB355\uBD84\u2019\uC774\uB77C\uBA70 \uAC10\uC0AC\uB97C \uC804\uD558\uAE30\uB3C4
        \uD588\uB294\uB370\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[3]'
      value: "\uD2B9\uD788\uB098 \uC774\uC0C1\uD604\uC0C1\uC744 \uBCF4\uC778 \uB85C\uBD07\uB4E4\uC744
        \uC131\uACF5\uC801\uC73C\uB85C \uC218\uB9AC\uD558\uBA70 \uB2E8\uB2E8\uD55C
        \uC0DD\uC0B0 \uCCB4\uACC4\uAC00 \uC778\uC0C1\uC801\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[4]'
      value: "\uBE44\uC815\uC0C1\uC801\uC778 \uACFC\uBD80\uD654 \uD604\uC0C1\uC744
        \uBCF4\uC600\uB358 \uC6D0\uC778\uC740 \uC81C\uB300\uB85C \uBC1D\uD600\uC9C0\uC9C0
        \uC54A\uC558\uC73C\uB098,\n\uB85C\uBD07\uB4E4\uC758 \uC2DC\uC2A4\uD15C\uC744
        \uCD08\uAE30\uD654\uD558\uACE0 \uBB38\uC81C\uB97C \uC644\uC804\uD788 \uD574\uACB0\uD588\uB2E4\uACE0
        \uBCF4\uACE0\uD588\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[5]'
      value: "\uD50C\uB8E8\uD1A0\uC2A4\uACF5\uC5C5\uC740 \uC55E\uC73C\uB85C\uB3C4
        \uC9C0\uC18D\uC801\uC778 \uAE30\uC220 \uD601\uC2E0\uC744 \uD1B5\uD574 \uC0DD\uC0B0\uC131\uC744
        \uB192\uC5EC\uB098\uAC08 \uACC4\uD68D\uC784\uC744 \uBC1D\uD614\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        ..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[6]'
      value: "<Ending 2/4 \u2014 \uB450 \uBC88\uC9F8 \uC5D4\uB529: \uB9DD\uAC01>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4981826221709989368, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
